CM_ "Byte 6: Counter (bits 0-3) + Status nibble (bits 4-7). Byte 7: CRC-8 SAE J1850 (poly 0x1D, init 0xFF, xorout 0xFF) over [ID low byte, ID high byte, byte 0..6]. E2E-inspired, not AUTOSAR compliant.";
